# D-Bus activation for Black-Bag as the Secret Service.
#
# Install to the USER directory, which overrides /usr/share:
#   install -Dm644 packaging/org.freedesktop.secrets.service \
#     ~/.local/share/dbus-1/services/org.freedesktop.secrets.service
#
# Then make sure nothing else is already holding the name at login — on Omarchy
# that means running gnome-keyring without its secrets component:
#   gnome-keyring-daemon --components=pkcs11,ssh   (drop "secrets")
# or not autostarting it. Check with:  black-bag secretservice doctor
#
# Set Exec to the absolute path of your installed black-bag.
[D-BUS Service]
Name=org.freedesktop.secrets
Exec=/home/sicarii/.local/bin/black-bag secretservice serve
